notes: V022 was explicitly requested by the owner as the next candidate after V021 even though V021 was not separately promoted. It adds frame-deduplicated class-aware cross-frame track IDs, two-point counting lines with one directional passage event per track/line, region entry/exit and dwell-time events including pedestrian waiting-zone dwell, persistent bounded flow-event history/CSV, and Flow / Tracks analytics while preserving V021 sampled occupancy analytics and signal-aware simulation. The tracker is a lightweight centroid/IoU prototype and may lose or swap IDs during heavy occlusion; unique passage counts therefore apply only to recorded counting-line events and remain prototype analytics. V021 is the previous candidate and owner-confirmed passed baseline remains V017 / 0_1_7. Physical public-road traffic control remains disabled.
